{"title": "Multiattack: Static Discharge", "pageid": 27870, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Multiattack:_Static_Discharge", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Multiattack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp/300px-Generic_Multiattack.webp, /w/images/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp/300px-Generic_Multiattack.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Multiattack: Static Discharge</b> is a passive feature that lets creatures <a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack\" title=\"Multiattack\">Multiattack</a> a creature that's under a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Static_Discharge_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Static Discharge Aura (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Static Discharge Aura\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Static_Discharge_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Static Discharge Aura (Condition)\">Static Discharge Aura</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Benard can <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Bernard)\" title=\"Multiattack (Bernard)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/25px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/38px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/50px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Multiattack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/25px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Bernard)\" title=\"Multiattack (Bernard)\">Multiattack</a> while under the effects of his <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Static_Discharge_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Static Discharge Aura (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Static Discharge Aura\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Static_Discharge_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Static Discharge Aura (Condition)\">Static Discharge Aura</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p><i>(Information not yet added.)</i>\n</p>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202003\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.047 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.069 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1168/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 8466/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3978/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 639911/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   63.116      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   63.116      1 -total\n 56.32%   35.549      1 Template:PageSeo\n 56.27%   35.513      2 Template:Cond\n 55.80%   35.220      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 45.56%   28.756      3 Template:Icon_link\n 44.64%   28.177      3 Template:Icon_text\n 40.56%   25.598      2 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 38.64%   24.389      6 Template:Trim\n 32.27%   20.367      3 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:27870-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202003 and revision id 168502. Rendering was tr